{"counts":{"canonical":12,"context":0,"total":12,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Vedic Age","历史分期","宗教传统"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ca9294b7753aa283a4226b07","summary":"吠陀时代是南亚历史中的长期阶段，教材采用约公元前一七〇〇至六〇〇年的范围，以吠陀宗教文本得名。相关叙述把这一阶段放在哈拉帕城市衰落之后，关注讲印度雅利安语言的人群迁入旁遮普，并逐渐向恒河流域扩展、同原有居民互动的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700年—公元前600年","end_year":-600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"南亚吠陀时代"},{"aliases":["Vedas","口传","经典"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["古代南亚吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-9424ac323ccff14a9bcb286a","summary":"吠陀宗教文本的早期形成，主要依靠口头创作与背诵传承。所引教材把这组文本的形成约置于公元前一五〇〇至九〇〇年；其中《梨俱吠陀》收有一千余首献给诸神的赞歌，是研究这一时期语言、宗教和生活的重要材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500年—公元前900年","end_year":-900,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"吠陀文本的口传形成阶段"},{"aliases":["Chavin (Archaeological Site)","祭祀建筑","石构工程"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["查文文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-34088c0f4e147299b1e2cc92","summary":"查文遗址坐落在秘鲁安第斯山的高山谷地，并为查文文化命名。这里的台地、广场和石砌建筑构成宗教仪式中心，内部还有廊道、通风设施与排水网络。建筑及石雕中反复出现人形、兽形图像，是理解当地宗教表达的实物线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前300年","end_year":-300,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"查文文化营建石构祭祀建筑"},{"aliases":["Jinsha Site","古蜀","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-2692aab5d3b5a97775bd9c9e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2692aab5d3b5a97775bd9c9e","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-17c6c026103edfd278a0158a","summary":"金沙遗址位于成都西部，是认识古蜀社会的重要考古地点。世界遗产预备名单申报说明把其兴起和放弃的大致时间列为公元前一二〇〇至六五〇年，指出它在三星堆之后发展，河流把宫殿性质区域与宗教祭祀区域分在南北两侧，西面另有居住区和墓地。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1200—前650年","end_year":-650,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1200},"title":"金沙遗址的古蜀聚落"},{"aliases":["Aguada Fénix","公共建筑","共同劳动"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["早期玛雅地区"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6183960412eed53b14652b28","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6183960412eed53b14652b28","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6e678e4600554692359df80f","summary":"阿瓜达菲尼克斯位于墨西哥塔巴斯科，庞大的低矮平台和九条宽阔堤道，曾因外形接近天然地表而不易辨识。研究团队利用机载激光雷达确定形态，再通过发掘与六十九份木炭样本测年，把主体营建置于约公元前一〇〇〇至八〇〇年。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1000—前800年","end_year":-800,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1000},"title":"阿瓜达费尼克斯群体营建大型平台与堤道"},{"aliases":["Kamegaoka Burial Site","丧葬","祭献"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-72858a91fe58887c00990a28","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-72858a91fe58887c00990a28","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-479b480f918388998561b723","summary":"龟冈遗址位于日本青森县津轻半岛的低丘，面向曾经的内湾环境，年代约为公元前一〇〇〇至四〇〇年。台地上分布多组土坑墓，出土陶器、宝石等供献品和随葬品；墓地长期使用，被官方介绍解释为持续祭祖活动的迹象。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1000—前400年","end_year":-400,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1000},"title":"龟冈群体营建墓地并埋置祭献物"},{"aliases":["散盤 / Pan water vessel of San","土地","契约","金文"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-70f49cfd9972c1386d37a8cf","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-70f49cfd9972c1386d37a8cf","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f3c3a67f8901a0dc32953a65","summary":"散盘是西周晚期的一件青铜水器，盘内三百五十字铭文以契约式内容著称。台北故宫的释读认为，铭文起于夨方攻打散邑所造成的纷争，随后以割让两区田地作为补偿，记录双方踏勘土地、树立界标及见证人员的情况。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前9—前8世纪（馆方页面范围不一）","end_year":-701,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-900},"title":"散盘铭文中的割地与履勘契约"},{"aliases":["Nok Culture","陶塑","冶铁"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["诺克文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2b8886893ec7797c24feb829","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2b8886893ec7797c24feb829","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d4ce959ef2dd86e0198c7883","summary":"诺克文化的主要阶段，研究者弗兰克置于约公元前九至四世纪。这一划分结合尼日利亚中部遗址的放射性碳年代、发光测年和陶器比较；它所指的是整组考古材料的发展阶段，而不是每一件陶塑都具有相同的制造年代。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前9世纪至前4世纪","end_year":-301,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-900},"title":"诺克主要阶段出现陶塑人物与冶铁生产"},{"aliases":["Manunggul Jar","陶器","二次葬","船形图像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-f4b2238401f700e3fa1edfb5","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f4b2238401f700e3fa1edfb5","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-bedc1d9f83c80b6251cbaf25","summary":"马农古尔陶罐出自菲律宾巴拉望岛的马农古尔洞穴，是盛放死者遗骸的葬器，资料定年约为公元前八九〇至七一〇年。罐体以陶土制成，上部曲线纹饰用赤铁矿红色颜料强调；最引人注目的部分，是盖上立体塑造的船与两个人物。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前890—前710年","end_year":-710,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-890},"title":"马农古尔制陶者制作双人船形盖葬罐"},{"aliases":["Battle of Qarqar","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述","黎凡特诸国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-e920d4235c543e4d3e616596","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-e920d4235c543e4d3e616596","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-0a082fb162093c5f236734a3","summary":"约公元前854至853年前后，沙尔马那塞尔三世率亚述军队向叙利亚方向进军，在卡尔卡尔同由大马士革、哈马、以色列等力量组成的联军交战。库尔赫碑留下了亚述一方的记载，列举敌方君主、战车和兵员。其十二王称呼与所列名单并不完全对应，不能简单据此复原各方部队的准确数量。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前854—前853年","end_year":-853,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-854},"title":"沙尔马那塞尔三世军队在卡尔卡尔与联军交战"}],"revision":"16e2d9bc7dac753e8ae63fc6d7d5464fd2e2ef9bb6dc2e0855171d4b9b35d835","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}